# BOBOS OS — Python Edition

BOBOS is a browser-based workspace powered by Python,
Flask, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Features

- BobAI demo assistant
- BobBible daily study and levels
- BobTrade virtual stock trading
- BobCode project editor and HTML preview
- BobShop demo storefront
- BobBusiness profit calculator
- BobFiles notes
- Bob3D and BobPCB starter sections
- Export workspace data
- Credits counter

## Installation

Install the packages:

    pip install -r requirements.txt

Start BOBOS:

    python app.py

Open the local address provided by Flask or your hosting
service.

## Project Structure

    BOBOS/
    ├── app.py
    ├── requirements.txt
    ├── README.md
    ├── bobos_data.json
    ├── templates/
    │   └── index.html
    └── static/
        ├── style.css
        └── app.js

The JSON data file is created when data is first saved.

## Important

This is a starter application. The AI responses are a demo,
stock prices are manually entered practice prices, and the
shop does not process payments.

Live AI, real-time market data, full Bible search, secure
accounts, and messaging require additional services.

Do not use this prototype to store passwords, payment
secrets, or sensitive customer information.
